<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-North half-year net profit A$50 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-North half-year net profit A$50 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					50  vs 33</p>
<p>NOTE: North ltd is a mining and forestry group.  </p>
<p>    Div (cents)			     4.0 vs 4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings before interest and tax by division.</p>
<p>    Iron ore				 66.1 vs 52.2</p>
<p>    Uranium				  27.6 vs 21.3</p>
<p>    Copper-gold			    11.4 vs loss 1.3</p>
<p>    Gold				     14.8 vs 18.9</p>
<p>    Zinc				 loss 0.9 vs nil</p>
<p>    Equipment				16.3 vs 18.6</p>
<p>    Forest Products			12.2 vs 12.3</p>
<p>    Other business			  0.6 vs 2.5</p>
<p>--Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1810</p>
